		<div class="footer-widget"><div id="text-24" class="fwidget et_pb_widget widget_text"><h4 class="title">Dì che La Torretta ti piace!</h4>			<div class="textwidget"><div class="fb-page" data-href="https://www.facebook.com/hotelristorantelatorretta" data-tabs="timeline" data-small-header="false" data-adapt-container-width="true" data-hide-cover="false" data-show-facepile="true"><div class="fb-xfbml-parse-ignore"><blockquote cite="https://www.facebook.com/hotelristorantelatorretta"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/hotelristorantelatorretta">Hotel Ristorante La Torretta</a></blockquote></div></div></div>
